  cal-20261002-058,cal-2026-10-02-s1,Will the Wilsonian renormalisation transfer protocol produce at least one usable effective variable from my Calibrator answers by the third session?,The spec plans to infer effective variables from repeated answers.,start a 'candidate effective variables' list now,wait for more data,calibration,70,55,80,55,80,explore,Resolved true if a #calibrator note naming an effective variable exists by the third session's export.,third session,unresolved,null,null,"2026-10-02T03:40:00Z"
  cal-20261002-015,cal-2026-10-02-s1,Will João Pedro play 60+ minutes in Gameweek 6?,He missed Gameweek 5 with a knee issue; Chelsea expect him back for Bournemouth.,keep or buy him,sell him before the deadline,news,60,75,55,50,78,exploit,Resolved from the FPL API minutes for João Pedro in Gameweek 6.,2026-10-12,unresolved,null,null,"2026-10-02T03:40:00Z"
  cal-20261002-083,cal-2026-10-02-s1,Is the monorepo-plus-mirror structure for visualisations a leaky abstraction I will regret?,Each visual lives in a standalone repository and is ported byte for byte.,pick one home per visual,keep both,project,65,60,65,75,74,exploit,Resolved true if a later commit message reports drift or a sync bug between a mirror and the site by 2026-12-31.,2026-12-31,unresolved,null,null,"2026-10-02T03:40:00Z"
  cal-20261002-026,cal-2026-10-02-s1,Will a Rillaboom-Incineroar glue team with one Mega be my best route to a positive ladder record?,These pairings lead Reg M-C cores at about 24% each.,build on the consensus glue,build an off-meta team around rain,notes,60,70,55,55,76,exploit,Resolved by a later note comparing win rates of the teams I laddered; unresolved otherwise.,2026-12-02,unresolved,null,null,"2026-10-02T03:40:00Z"
  cal-20261002-068,cal-2026-10-02-s1,Will I do at least eight 30-minute strength sessions in October?,"The plan is two a week; the 1,000-day horizon matters more than single sessions.",schedule them now,keep it flexible,notes,60,70,50,65,74,exploit,Resolved by a later note counting October sessions; unresolved otherwise.,2026-11-01,unresolved,null,null,"2026-10-02T03:40:00Z"
  cal-20261002-041,cal-2026-10-02-s1,Is my 'brain and hands' split clear enough that a crewmate knows when to escalate rather than improvise?,My note asked to define it precisely.,write the escalation rule down this week,rely on the current brief,notes,60,60,65,70,78,exploit,Resolved by a later note or committed doc stating the escalation rule; unresolved otherwise.,2026-10-31,unresolved,null,null,"2026-10-02T03:40:00Z"
  cal-20261002-028,cal-2026-10-02-s1,Will copying Kaieda's Global Challenge-winning Salamence-Floette team underperform for me because counters have risen?,My metagame note predicts winners draw their own counters.,build my own variant,copy the winning team,news,60,60,60,70,74,exploit,Resolved by a later note recording my results with a copied winning team; unresolved if not played.,2026-12-02,unresolved,null,null,"2026-10-02T03:40:00Z"
  cal-20261002-019,cal-2026-10-02-s1,Will Fulham assets outscore Brighton assets over Gameweeks 6–8?,"Fulham face Ipswich, Hull, Coventry; Brighton have the best goal difference.",double up on Fulham,stay on Brighton defence,news,55,70,60,55,74,exploit,Resolved by summing FPL API points of Fulham's and Brighton's three highest-owned players over Gameweeks 6–8.,2026-10-25,unresolved,null,null,"2026-10-02T03:40:00Z"
  cal-20261002-064,cal-2026-10-02-s1,Is my structural-engineering study aimed at a job or credential rather than curiosity?,Seven dense beam notes plus a recap deck in one day.,name the career goal and plan for it,keep it as curiosity,notes,65,55,75,60,72,explore,Unresolvable automatically unless a later note states the goal; then resolved true if the goal is career-linked.,2026-12-31,unresolved,null,null,"2026-10-02T03:40:00Z"
  cal-20261002-065,cal-2026-10-02-s1,Will I start any of the four AI certificates I listed by the end of October?,"Google, DataCamp, Microsoft and Stanford CS221 were listed on 28 Sep.",enrol in one this week,drop certificates,notes,60,60,60,70,72,exploit,Resolved true if a later note records enrolment or progress in one of the four by 2026-10-31.,2026-10-31,unresolved,null,null,"2026-10-02T03:40:00Z"
  cal-20261002-027,cal-2026-10-02-s1,Is the Politoed-Archaludon rain lift I noticed just selection bias?,"3 of 13 high-performing Baltimore teams, from 26 of 512 in the field.",drop the rain idea,test rain in 20 games,notes,65,55,55,70,74,explore,"Resolved by later Reg M-C top-cut data: true if rain teams' top-cut share is no higher than their field share across the next two regionals' data.",2026-12-02,unresolved,null,null,"2026-10-02T03:40:00Z"
  cal-20261002-057,cal-2026-10-02-s1,"Is the noncommutative-geometry thread (rotation algebra, thermal time) the one I would drop first if forced?","Seven NCG notes on 25 Sep, none since.",drop NCG for now,keep NCG,synthesis,60,55,65,70,74,exploit,Resolved true if no NCG-tagged note appears between 2026-10-02 and 2026-12-31.,2026-12-31,unresolved,null,null,"2026-10-02T03:40:00Z"
  cal-20261002-100,cal-2026-10-02-s1,"Is the 2,500-PR anecdote making me measure my own agent work by PR count?",This week's output is measured in merged PRs.,track decisions or learning instead,keep PR count,synthesis,60,50,70,80,74,explore,Unresolvable automatically unless a later note states the metric I use.,2026-12-31,unresolved,null,null,"2026-10-02T03:40:00Z"
  cal-20261002-066,cal-2026-10-02-s1,Are certificates a worse signal for me than the public repositories I already ship?,30 public repositories updated in the last day.,"skip certificates, curate a portfolio page",pursue a certificate,synthesis,60,55,65,70,70,explore,Unresolvable automatically unless a later note reports a hiring or reviewer reaction to either; then resolved by it.,2027-03-31,unresolved,null,null,"2026-10-02T03:40:00Z"
  cal-20261002-080,cal-2026-10-02-s1,"Will the Bitter Lesson apply to my own FPL and VGC analysis, so a general model beats my hand features?",I hand-craft features like xGI gaps and usage shares.,test a general model's picks against mine,keep hand features,synthesis,60,50,80,70,70,explore,Resolved by a later note comparing a general model's picks with mine; unresolved otherwise.,2026-12-31,unresolved,null,null,"2026-10-02T03:40:00Z"
  cal-20261002-042,cal-2026-10-02-s1,"Would a weaker, cheaper model as a deliberate devil's advocate improve my decisions more than another strong agent?",My note says flawed analysis forces scrutiny.,add a weak-model critique step to one workflow,keep strong models only,notes,60,50,75,65,72,explore,Resolved by a later note reporting the outcome of such a trial; unresolved otherwise.,2026-11-30,unresolved,null,null,"2026-10-02T03:40:00Z"
  cal-20261002-018,cal-2026-10-02-s1,Will a cheap busy goalkeeper like Tzolakis outscore Raya over Gameweeks 6–10?,Tzolakis leads keepers with 34 points at £4.7m via saves.,start the cheap keeper,pay for Raya,notes,55,60,50,60,75,exploit,Resolved from FPL API totals for Tzolakis and Raya over Gameweeks 6–10.,2026-11-22,unresolved,null,null,"2026-10-02T03:40:00Z"
  cal-20261002-054,cal-2026-10-02-s1,Does the forced Navier–Stokes blowup make convex integration less worth studying for me?,Forced blowup builds on Córdoba and Martínez-Zoroa; unforced remains open.,drop convex integration from my list,keep it,news,60,50,80,60,70,explore,Resolved by a later note on fluid PDE study plans; unresolved otherwise.,2026-12-31,unresolved,null,null,"2026-10-02T03:40:00Z"
  cal-20261002-040,cal-2026-10-02-s1,Will the grilling skill's compaction amendment ever be made if it was just marked resolved?,PR 122 closes the grilling todo without an answer.,amend grilling this week,accept it as dropped,notes,55,55,60,70,72,exploit,Resolved true if yujieteo/skills changes the grilling skill to preserve decisions and next action by 2026-11-02.,2026-11-02,unresolved,null,null,"2026-10-02T03:40:00Z"
  cal-20261002-082,cal-2026-10-02-s1,Will deployment and operations take more of my time than features over the next month?,"This week included CI budgets, test moves and mirrors.",simplify the deployment path,keep the current path,notes,55,55,60,60,70,exploit,"Resolved true if chore, ci, test and docs commits outnumber feat commits in yujieteo/site between 2026-10-03 and 2026-11-02.",2026-11-02,unresolved,null,null,"2026-10-02T03:40:00Z"
  cal-20261002-070,cal-2026-10-02-s1,"Will I build any of the four learning projects (full-stack app, DevOps container, compiler, automation) by year end?",Listed 24 Sep; agents already build most site features.,start the compiler this month,drop the list,notes,55,55,55,70,68,explore,Resolved true if a yujieteo repository for one of the four exists with working code by 2026-12-31.,2026-12-31,unresolved,null,null,"2026-10-02T03:40:00Z"
  cal-20261002-037,cal-2026-10-02-s1,Will Claude Code reading AGENTS.md let me delete my CLAUDE.md shims within a month?,Claude Code 2.1.277 falls back to AGENTS.md; skills in .agents/skills are still not detected.,remove CLAUDE.md shims from my repositories,keep both files,news,55,55,60,45,72,exploit,Resolved true if yujieteo repositories with both files drop CLAUDE.md by 2026-11-02.,2026-11-02,unresolved,null,null,"2026-10-02T03:40:00Z"
  cal-20261002-081,cal-2026-10-02-s1,Does an LLM judge need human-labelled calibration before I let it grade my visualisations?,Agents currently self-assess shipped visualisations.,hand-label ten visuals and compare,trust the agent judge,notes,55,50,60,65,70,explore,Resolved by a later note reporting agreement between an LLM judge and my labels; unresolved otherwise.,2026-12-31,unresolved,null,null,"2026-10-02T03:40:00Z"
  cal-20261002-089,cal-2026-10-02-s1,"Is Reg M-C worth my time only until 2 December, after which notes go stale?",The format ends 2 December; my VGC notes are format-specific.,write format-independent VGC principles only,keep format-specific notes,news,55,50,65,60,70,exploit,Resolved true if later VGC notes after 2026-12-02 cite Reg M-C notes as still useful; false if not.,2027-01-31,unresolved,null,null,"2026-10-02T03:40:00Z"
  cal-20261002-092,cal-2026-10-02-s1,Will I use the Fermi estimator or information-gain visual to make a real decision this month?,Both were added 1 Oct; decision tools only matter if used.,use one on an open decision this week,leave them,project,55,50,60,65,70,exploit,Resolved by a later note citing either tool for a decision; unresolved otherwise.,2026-10-31,unresolved,null,null,"2026-10-02T03:40:00Z"
  cal-20261002-056,cal-2026-10-02-s1,Would a motives-and-periods visualisation teach me more than another mental-computation note?,Marcolli asks whether Feynman residues are periods of mixed Tate motives.,build a small periods visual,write notes,notes,55,50,65,50,72,explore,Resolved by a later note judging such a visualisation; unresolved if none is built.,2026-12-31,unresolved,null,null,"2026-10-02T03:40:00Z"
  cal-20261002-095,cal-2026-10-02-s1,"Will my site still be primarily a notes site, not a visualisation gallery, by year end?",Visual commits now dominate.,rebalance toward notes,embrace the gallery,synthesis,55,45,60,60,74,explore,"Resolved by comparing notes-entry growth with catalogue growth between 2026-10-02 and 2026-12-31: true if notes entries grow by more than catalogue records.",2026-12-31,unresolved,null,null,"2026-10-02T03:40:00Z"
  cal-20261002-022,cal-2026-10-02-s1,Will my FPL overall rank after Gameweek 10 be better than after Gameweek 5?,"The notes favour cheap defenders, xGI and fixture runs.",keep the data-led approach,rethink the approach at Gameweek 10,notes,55,50,50,45,72,exploit,Resolved by a later note recording overall rank at Gameweeks 5 and 10; unresolved otherwise.,2026-11-22,unresolved,null,null,"2026-10-02T03:40:00Z"
  cal-20261002-087,cal-2026-10-02-s1,Are LLM false-premise failures already biting my agent fleet?,Notes flag false premises; agents take briefs as truth.,audit three recent briefs for false premises,skip,notes,55,45,65,60,68,explore,Resolved by a later note reporting a false-premise failure or an audit finding none.,2026-11-30,unresolved,null,null,"2026-10-02T03:40:00Z"
  cal-20261002-079,cal-2026-10-02-s1,Should the next Calibrator session drop FPL questions if I skip most of them here?,Skips are a negative selection signal.,drop FPL from generation,keep FPL,calibration,50,45,50,40,75,exploit,Resolved true if more than half of this session's FPL questions are skipped.,next session,unresolved,null,null,"2026-10-02T03:40:00Z"
  cal-20261002-091,cal-2026-10-02-s1,Would predicting the Stuttgart top cut in advance be a cheap calibration test of my VGC reading?,Usage and conversion differ; predictions test both.,write a top-cut prediction note before 28 Nov,skip,synthesis,55,40,75,45,66,explore,Resolved true if a dated prediction note exists before 2026-11-28 and is scored afterwards.,2026-11-30,unresolved,null,null,"2026-10-02T03:40:00Z"
  cal-20261002-043,cal-2026-10-02-s1,Is the Mac agent-workstation migration still worth doing now that I already run firstmate on this machine?,The todo is marked resolved in PR 122 without an outcome.,write the setup skill from what exists,drop the migration,notes,45,45,55,60,65,exploit,Resolved by a later note recording the workstation setup state; unresolved otherwise.,2026-11-30,unresolved,null,null,"2026-10-02T03:40:00Z"
  cal-20261002-093,cal-2026-10-02-s1,Is the convex 15-minute bet visual something I actually use before starting work?,It exists as a public tool; no notes cite it.,use it daily for a week,retire it,project,45,45,55,60,65,explore,Resolved by a later note citing the tool; unresolved otherwise.,2026-10-31,unresolved,null,null,"2026-10-02T03:40:00Z"
  cal-20261002-099,cal-2026-10-02-s1,Are tools that test WebMCP-registered pages for safe behaviour worth building before anyone calls them?,My notes call for realistic task tests; there are no callers yet.,defer WebMCP evaluation,build the evaluation now,synthesis,45,45,55,60,64,exploit,Resolved true if no WebMCP evaluation harness is committed by 2026-12-31.,2026-12-31,unresolved,null,null,"2026-10-02T03:40:00Z"
  cal-20261002-049,cal-2026-10-02-s1,Will site CI wall time stay under its budget for the next month without more test pruning?,CI now budgets suites and tests changed folders only.,trust the budget,schedule another pruning pass,project,45,45,50,45,70,exploit,Resolved true if no commit between 2026-10-03 and 2026-11-02 removes tests citing CI time.,2026-11-02,unresolved,null,null,"2026-10-02T03:40:00Z"
  cal-20261002-088,cal-2026-10-02-s1,Would replacing ten visualisations' tests with one smoke check lose anything I would notice?,Tests moved to standalone repos this week.,cut to smoke checks,keep logic tests,project,45,40,55,70,62,exploit,Resolved by a later commit or note recording a regression a removed test would have caught; unresolved otherwise.,2026-12-31,unresolved,null,null,"2026-10-02T03:40:00Z"
  cal-20261002-096,cal-2026-10-02-s1,"Would Sonnet 5.5, when released, be good enough for most of my porting work?",Sonnet 5.5 is due within weeks; ports are mechanical.,trial it on ports when released,keep Opus,news,45,45,55,35,65,exploit,Resolved by a later note comparing Sonnet 5.5 and Opus on ports; unresolved otherwise.,2026-11-30,unresolved,null,null,"2026-10-02T03:40:00Z"
  cal-20261002-059,cal-2026-10-02-s1,Is information cohomology worth one afternoon of study given my entropy-combinatorics lab?,Any chain-rule quantity defines a cohomology; the lab already exists.,spend one afternoon on information cohomology,skip it,notes,45,40,70,35,65,explore,Resolved by a later note on information cohomology; unresolved otherwise.,2026-12-31,unresolved,null,null,"2026-10-02T03:40:00Z"
  cal-20261002-098,cal-2026-10-02-s1,Would deleting half the token-reduction tools I listed lose me anything?,My note says such tools need expiry dates.,delete the unused ones,keep them,notes,40,40,50,60,62,exploit,Resolved by a later note recording which tools were kept; unresolved otherwise.,2026-11-30,unresolved,null,null,"2026-10-02T03:40:00Z"
  cal-20261002-084,cal-2026-10-02-s1,Would a source-backed data-visualisation skill like Karpathy's jobs treemap have been built by now if it were important?,Todo marked resolved; the interactive-visual-spec skill landed 2 Oct.,check whether interactive-visual-spec covers it and close,build the narrow skill,notes,40,40,50,55,62,exploit,Resolved by a later note on whether the skill covers source-backed scoring; unresolved otherwise.,2026-11-30,unresolved,null,null,"2026-10-02T03:40:00Z"
  cal-20261002-072,cal-2026-10-02-s1,Is the cerebral-folate research question worth an hour of literature search this month?,It was marked resolved without an answer.,do the hour,drop it,notes,45,40,55,50,55,explore,Resolved by a later note summarising evidence on cerebral folate deficiency and autism; unresolved otherwise.,2026-12-31,unresolved,null,null,"2026-10-02T03:40:00Z"
  cal-20261002-050,cal-2026-10-02-s1,"Should microblogging be added to the site, given notes already serve as dated short posts?",Todo marked resolved in PR 122 without an implementation.,treat notes as the microblog and stop,build a status feed,notes,40,40,50,55,60,exploit,Resolved true if no microblog feature ships by 2026-12-31.,2026-12-31,unresolved,null,null,"2026-10-02T03:40:00Z"
  cal-20261002-060,cal-2026-10-02-s1,Should I state Kontsevich's formality theorem precisely now that the todo was closed without doing it?,PR 122 closes it unanswered.,write the precise statement in 20 minutes,leave it,notes,40,40,50,55,60,exploit,Resolved true if a note gives a precise statement of Kontsevich's theorem by 2026-11-02.,2026-11-02,unresolved,null,null,"2026-10-02T03:40:00Z"
  cal-20261002-094,cal-2026-10-02-s1,Should the Singapore and company-finance data visualisations get a refresh plan rather than a one-off publish?,Several cite 'latest filed accounts' that will age.,add a refresh date to each,accept them as dated snapshots,project,40,40,45,45,58,exploit,Resolved true if refresh dates are added to those catalogue records by 2026-12-31.,2026-12-31,unresolved,null,null,"2026-10-02T03:40:00Z"
  cal-20261002-085,cal-2026-10-02-s1,Is option-pricing and tail-risk finance a dormant interest I should drop from my notes?,"No finance notes since the Taleb notes of 2025, beyond FPL and cash-conversion visuals.",drop it explicitly,revive it with one note,notes,40,35,60,55,55,explore,Resolved true if no #finance note other than FPL appears by 2026-12-31.,2026-12-31,unresolved,null,null,"2026-10-02T03:40:00Z"
  cal-20261002-086,cal-2026-10-02-s1,Will the branching-process threshold intuition (survival ≈ 2ε) change how I judge which projects will take off?,"Near threshold, small reproduction gains matter a lot.",estimate each project's 'R' monthly,ignore the analogy,notes,40,35,75,40,55,explore,Unresolvable automatically unless a later note applies it.,2027-04-01,unresolved,null,null,"2026-10-02T03:40:00Z"
  cal-20261002-090,cal-2026-10-02-s1,Will I attend or watch the Stuttgart Regionals on 28–29 November?,The last Reg M-C regional in Europe before the format ends.,plan to follow it and test predictions,skip,news,40,35,55,30,62,explore,Resolved by a later note referencing Stuttgart results; unresolved otherwise.,2026-11-30,unresolved,null,null,"2026-10-02T03:40:00Z"
