  cal-20261002-008,s3,The only resolved todo before 2026-10-02 was closed by pointing at a published visualisation.
  cal-20261002-011,s1,Over half of poll respondents plan to wildcard in Gameweek 6.
  cal-20261002-011,s1,Cons include limited fixture swings outside Fulham and Gameweek 7 possibly being a better entry point.
  cal-20261002-011,s2,"The guide advises locking structure, not final players, and waiting for the final 72 hours before transfers."
