  cal-20261002-023,s1,Regulation M-C runs from 9 September to 2 December 2026.
  cal-20261002-023,s1,The VR October Challenge is online on 3–4 October 2026; Stuttgart Regionals are 28–29 November 2026.
  cal-20261002-023,s1,Global Challenge I was won by Joji Kaieda with Mega Salamence and Mega Floette.
  cal-20261002-023,s2,Game 1 of a best-of-three is a chance to learn the opponent's revealed sets as well as to win.
  cal-20261002-003,s1,The catalogue holds 55 visualisation records and 17 pins to the visuals repository.
  cal-20261002-003,s2,The note checks the force-method answer against the site's beam diagram creator and its exact-arithmetic reference solver.
  cal-20261002-003,s3,"Agent tooling should help me become a better human, not merely replace more tasks."
  cal-20261002-003,s4,Karpathy prioritises building working code over posts or slides.
  cal-20261002-031,s1,The aim is to move ourselves out of the loop as much as possible.
  cal-20261002-031,s2,Treat review effort as risk-dependent rather than mandatory ceremony for every prototype.
